    GlobalTheory.T.kappa_mem_lineLatticeCompletion_iff_scalar D k ι p I P hP n' ρ σ B B' l S α α₀ M LS Λ hM hLS (fun i => ⟨(hfr i).1, (hfr i).2.2.1⟩) x hx]
